  <item>
    <title>ep35. 让身体看看谁才是真正的主人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c26664cf50611d13a466bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c26664cf50611d13a466bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 10:38:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>chatper I</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 海南是浣熊的第二故乡 也是俄罗斯人的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 浣熊终于学会了“用身体”生活</span></p><p><span>chapter II</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 毛毛对于身体觉知的感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 身体像一个容器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 陈翠梅《野蛮人入侵》- 灵魂是身体的牢笼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> I need to work on my body</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 《生命是什么》- 意识晚于身体产生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 过度思考会伤害身体吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 表层和深层肌肉和情绪的链接</span></p><p><span>chapter III</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 妮妮受伤之后开始关注和身体的交流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 普拉提呼吸的想象力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 对身体部位和内脏的觉知</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 不同流派的运动康复 和冥想相通的地方</span></p><p><span>chapter IV</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 健康问题的连锁反应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 脏器和性格的联系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 免疫系统应急</span></p><p><span>chapter V</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> 性格会被因为身体改变吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 创伤性情绪进食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 对自己的鼓励解除依赖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 点香薰也很解压</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 直面甲沟炎和缺颗牙</span></p><p><span>配乐：</span></p><p><span>Intro: Everything I am- Ye</span></p><p><span>Outro: ETA- New Jeans (Gmin REMIX)</span></p>]]></description>
