  <item>
    <title>ep34. 《坠落的审判》我们是否能够真正地共情？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6619320f48c40e2fb0ee199b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6619320f48c40e2fb0ee199b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Apr 2024 13:07:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 开放式结局和视角的切换</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 弹钢琴的情绪和情节点的呼应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 儿子的视角至关重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">4:50</a> 肢体暴力一旦开启覆水难收</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">6:15</a> 女主很少展示脆弱的一面 男主经常展示癫狂的一面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 经典的争吵桥段：Are they talking over each other?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 男主深陷受害者心态 是否能真正获得女主的共情？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 一直被消耗也会失去耐心 被愧疚深深困住</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> guilt trip和过分补偿心态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 有意义vs无意义的牺牲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 婚姻关系中的极致拉扯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 看的时候为了两个人感到痛苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 能力和power和悬殊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 悲痛的代价太大了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 女主否定了男主的全部价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 关系失衡的时候会真的想要伤害对方吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 恐惧 阴暗面 无法原谅自己的课题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 当原本的问题没有被解决 在极端的情况下就会被放大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 突破点在男主身上 男主的软弱和被抛弃妄想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 是否需要把男主当成病人看待 女主更高的精神的追求可能也是自救</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 自愈进程的差距其实很残酷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 女主的情绪稳定让她成为更好的parent</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> post trauma维持生活的秩序和节奏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 男主情感细腻感受力强 但承担了更多业力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> sex life的讨论反映了关系中的power dynamic</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 通过自杀来夺回power</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 录音的目的和意义 两个人变得陌生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 男主录音行为的心理暗示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> 结局让人觉得荒唐 但也代表了儿子的选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> 女主多线暧昧的关系</span></p><p><span>Song:</span></p><p><span>Outro: 流浪者之歌— 陈绮贞</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lji0JyP3hxmpUNVKYiv19eLH4mYY.m4a" length="113642472" type="audio/mp4"/>
