  <item>
    <title>ep33. 亚马逊丛林的死藤水帮我开启了灵性觉醒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660252f91519139e4fa06363</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660252f91519139e4fa06363</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Mar 2024 04:45:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">0:35</a> 如何和秘鲁亚马逊丛林的死藤水相识？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> My name is James 我一直对xx有兴趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 世界上最厉害的xx What’s special about it?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 2022年被裁员之后 阴差阳错空出来的位置</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 纯天然产生的致幻剂 来到了秘鲁的灵修中心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 同行的人来自哪里 有什么特殊的经历或创伤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 原本用来疗愈和治病 南美是最灵性的地方</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">9:16</a> 萨满教关于死藤水的传统 原本只有萨满在喝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 作为一个ritual帮助寻找丢失的儿童</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 灵修中心的大概布局 有哪些准备工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 第一天的经历 没感觉到什么特别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 清洗创伤之前要再经历一遍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 第二天喝了60ml 开始看到奇特的景象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 看到了世界的尽头 Apocalyptic scenes&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 无法承受的可怕景象 让我不想回到hut里面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 让我深刻的体会到了母亲过世前的痛苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 我们这一组的能量非常的黑暗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 有人之前半途放弃 整个活动被搁置了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 第二天我感到了深深的恐惧 但是学会了控制这种情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 颠覆了所有之前的认知 “全知全解” 对大自然充满了敬畏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 之后整整一年我都在寻找意义 到底什么是重要的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 我感受到了“死亡”的具体形态感受 回到自然 回到永恒 我重生了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 突然想到母亲的痛苦 but I let it go 我把爱传给了别人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 有没有可能不经历suffering直接获得疗愈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 我们出生是否是一张白纸 看到past lives</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 痛苦的记忆储存在身体里 瑜伽trigger了过去的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 我们最终都将回归宇宙 我就是宇宙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> But we only suffer alone there’s no way out</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 痛苦有尽头吗？Happiness is a choice&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 爱是本我的状态 痛苦是自我的体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 带着遗留的业力活着 经常感觉被身体困住</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 我和本我产生的分离 我希望逃离人形</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 我为什么不是一个钢琴？一个遥控器？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 突然跳出身体第三视角看自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> 面对死亡的孤独感 是一切痛苦的本质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 意识到灵魂的本质是完整的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> depressed了之后突然看到了艺术</span></p><p><span>Songs:</span></p><p><span>Intro: Shenzhou- Yin Yin</span></p><p><span>Outro: Pingpxng- Yin Yin</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhkdhV5r1TCGC-uKK60JsJ2plkKc.m4a" length="97692098" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:36</itunes:duration>
