    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep32. 2023折叠的一年：道士/打工/价值/道德和人生瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c5a3bd35dd8780edac2d08</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c5a3bd35dd8780edac2d08</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Feb 2024 04:02:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> 2023像是折叠的一年 什么时候脱困？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 今年年初和道士聊了聊 天生就爱玩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 说我适合帮人策划财务 放弃艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 关于金融的一些哲思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 和缅甸的一些奇怪缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 对正桃花的描述 像浣熊一样的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 浣熊妈妈和一个道士奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 一切都是full circle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 身体和头脑需要做体操</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 讨厌打工不等于讨厌工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 文科课让人看到了观点的多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> ethics道德课上提出的讨论问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 商业道德基于人文道德本身？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 商业的唯一目的是利益最大化？还是创造力和巧思的体现？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 毛毛立马改变她的ideology</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 疯狂截图毛毛训斥的表情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 在班里作为一个liberal的存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 在商学院最有趣的是观点的碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> Is business a social science?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 企业是否会剥削人的价值感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 消费者社会的价值感来自哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 我感到无聊是因为我穷吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> Does it really take away the pain?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 世界末日来了 我还会选择去上班吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> What if我没有什么想创造的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 2023年大家的“人生瞬间”</span></p><span></span><p><span>Songs:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Intro: 让我们平静地走进黑夜-- 小老虎</span></p><span></span><p><span>outro：You Deserve This-- Men I Trust</span></p>]]></description>
