  <item>
    <title>ep31. 穿越中亚：乌兹别克斯坦与哈萨克斯坦旅记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653aa2863077ad67f1738a45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653aa2863077ad67f1738a45</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Oct 2023 17:31:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 从莫斯科往回走 飞到伊犁的另一边</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 另外两个斯坦都没去成！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 提前读了《失落的卫星》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">6:15</a> 流在血液中的俄罗斯文学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 沉默的国度 被世界遗忘了吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 抓饭中心 和新疆美食的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 被吉尔吉斯斯坦拒签耿耿于怀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 乌兹别克国图有哪些藏书8</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> “百变”的塔什干 巴扎应有尽有</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 开朗的精神面貌 不同的民族性格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 哈萨克斯坦独特的街道建筑风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 动荡历史造成了如今的社会局面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a> 比比哈努清真寺 浣熊差点噶了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 浣熊靠可爱搞到饭的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 浣熊靠可爱换奶喝的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> 热情的哈撒人民</span></p><p><span>旅行照片:</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutLhgfIevP3HkfUmT01UdftAXNE.jpeg"></figure><p><span>普希金饭店</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8m_YOyMD1pC81mVeBxQw4Ajsm7.jpeg"></figure><p><span>莫斯科河</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjZSh0-6gBqxztdrwybEE91W3wo.jpeg"></figure><p><span>撒马尔罕—夏伊辛达</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjW0Fyn30RdrRfhnEjDpEM19CNlE.jpeg"></figure><p><span>亚洲抓饭中心</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuL1J9OKxBNlmqo6-Ft23ZXyOcqL.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRR4KbHZKbinh_PWI_9A68TYBGb.jpeg"></figure><p><span>大阿拉木图湖</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrGVOIMSaVPeNui1OIwLxd-fbVi.jpeg"></figure><p><span>雷吉斯坦广场灯光秀</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsK84J_Y3Fn8HzefB1GC2PKQrYe_.jpeg"></figure><p><span>巴扎大南瓜</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4CnbBARunnulr0jzkFENyrKER_.jpeg"></figure><p><span>巨好吃的阿拉木图的格鲁吉亚餐厅</span></p><p><span>Songs：</span></p><p><span>Intro: Asuu — NaraBara</span></p><p><span>Outro: A gift — Zion.T</span></p>]]></description>
