  <item>
    <title>ep30. 芭比：经历了现实世界，她决定成为女人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64cd13f1f50b650b28ffaba1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64cd13f1f50b650b28ffaba1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Aug 2023 15:06:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">0:58</a> 没法真正讨厌Ken 芭比的世界很简单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 在现实世界被友好对待 辛辣风格发挥出三成</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 独特的叙事芭比成为女性之前的旅程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">7:20</a> 同样展示了男性的困境 顶多算是吐槽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">8:21</a> 像芭比一样美 一样情绪稳定 一样处处完美</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">9:40</a> 所有的抨击没有打到到男权身上</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 资本家大反派也有redeeming qualities</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 有在努力尝试在颠覆已有的男性叙事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 哦是吗? 现实中的男的可不是这样的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 性别之后的主体感 存在主义的探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 无性社会— 社会性别— 生理性别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 没有性别意识下也不会有性别的dynamic</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 接受了自己的社会性别 接受自己的身体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> 芭比改写了被物化的命运 成为了自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 解放家庭主妇 也制造了新的身材焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 对女性的剥削一直没有停止</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 营销导向让人以为是所谓的“女性向”电影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> “全能妈妈”的陷阱 隐形剥削无处不在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 女性更多的社会责任 女性是第一性的社会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 芭比是第一性 Ken是附属 如果反过来呢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> motivation是求偶 雌竞本身是无意义的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 第三幕内斗的解决方式反而很真实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> Louis CK眼中男孩和女孩的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a> 被“捧杀”的母爱 自我牺牲的陷阱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 每个人身上都兼具男性女性的能量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 芭比创造者的初衷 她empower了自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 跳出传统ending的模版 "男性拯救者"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3084">51:24</a> 小美人鱼要的不是王子是灵性探索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 方头明们功不可没 感受x10000</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> Imagine a day as a woman</span></p><p><span>Songs:</span></p><p><span>cupcakKe - Lawd Jesus</span></p><p><span>Mahalia - Hide Out</span></p><p><span>Woman's Hour - Her Ghost</span></p>]]></description>
