  <item>
    <title>ep28. 透过Ultimatum《最后通牒》看人格障碍和PTSD</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64986005932f350aae0d9028</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64986005932f350aae0d9028</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 15:40:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">0:09</a> 前情提要 显性NPD VS 隐形NPD</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">1:18</a> 5对cp背景介绍+关系阐述</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">6:20</a> 从Lexi&amp;Rae想到过去的行为</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">7:10</a> 这个节目的设置：两周trial marriage</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">8:40</a> Lexi和Vanessa的beef以及和Rae的三角关系 "finger gate"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> Rae破罐破摔 长反射弧 缺少清晰边界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> Lexi善于操纵narrative 用细节挑拨情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 本质上还是reflect两人不平衡关系 Vanessa不停被抓出来鞭尸 Rae出轨？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 回避型依恋人格x2 Xander天生的lover</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 同一天的处女座咋差这么多？Vanessa的爸爸真正的“大魔王”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> Yoly和Xander到底是怎么好上的 “我可以随时随地开始” 看似恋爱脑但能及时止损 全身而退</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> Yoly的复杂性 是真爱为什么不坚定选择？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> Latina和Chinese的激烈碰撞💥 Mildrid平等地吼每个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> PTSD典型的表现：如果我更过分一点 你会不会离开我？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> Aussie和Sam竟然还在一起？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> stuck在“中国妈妈”和“中国儿子”的身体里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a> 三观正常的Natasha一下火了 最佳主持人选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> Mal对自身masculinity和femininity都secure</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> Lexi's new girlfriend 半个网黄 最好的关系就是能一起赚钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> Rae其实超级有个性 “善恶观”会被带跑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> Rae目前没有能力主动跟Lexi分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 来自拉美裔的血脉压制 Mildrid一直拿race说事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 对亚裔拧巴 自我压抑的刻板印象被再度核实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> Vanessa为什么变成众矢之的 过分自信惹到了所有人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">1:07:40</a> 节目之后Mal和Lexi的友谊 Lexi高能量导致两人互相欣赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">1:09:10</a> 看完之后觉得处处在照镜子 一生善于自省的东亚女人 Mildrid永远在找架吵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">1:17:00</a> 进入每一段关系都是带着mission的</span></p><p><span>Songs</span></p><p><span>Intro：</span></p><p><span>Here B4- JNR Williams</span></p><p><span>Interlude：</span></p><p><span>You Don't Listen- General Electrik</span></p><p><span>Outro：</span></p><p><span>橘子汽水- 窦靖童</span></p>]]></description>
