  <item>
    <title>ep27. 《继承之战》最终篇: &quot;It&apos;s all bullshit&quot; 虚妄的权力和自我救赎</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648419fae68894365dd3eeb8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648419fae68894365dd3eeb8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jun 2023 06:36:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这期节目中，我们召集了七位因为Succession继承之战而结识的网友，一同讨论这部史诗级美剧的最终篇章。对谈嘉宾（不分先后）：</span><em><span>Dandelion、Richelle、读佛心得、春雨咩、Mia、NerdComm、Starlit Sky、J.Deer、虎虎泥</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 最高热度cp tomgreg 百年孤独式结局</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> sibs当中谁会先走出来 Shiv is in deeper shit</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> Roman恋父又恋母 一场Logan模仿大赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 厨房scene：相亲相爱还是相爱相杀？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> Matsson最有killer instinct 典型tech guy</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> KRS的内在小孩 长不大的巨婴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 极端自恋的父亲造就内核匮乏的孩子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 脱离有毒循环是机会 Kendall反抗的意识 Roman重感情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> Logan教科书NPD手段：三角测量 play favorite 双重困境</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> KRS深陷权利与精神困境 对PUA有意识但无意改变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 无法展现脆弱 冒犯的语言风格是防御的表现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 每个人打工人都greg过 Tom出色的向上和向下管理能力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> Self-made的Tom和Logan有很强大的内心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 出企业家 “二代诅咒” 三个孩子谁的能力最强？ KRS各有天赋 Shiv公关一流 上一辈更容易出实干家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 很多角色都现实的原型 代表了传统传媒企业向科技数字的转型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> KRS的集合是最靠近Logan的 放弃模仿Logan是最后的救赎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 传播方式的变革让过去的模式不再相关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">1:03:00</a> 当代科技大佬很多本质上都是Logan 亲身经历的toxic culture</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3856">1:04:16</a> NPD为什么更容易成功？获得了金钱和权利牺牲了爱和价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 社会对NPD的奖励机制 自身的孽力回馈 Dating culture中的自恋者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">1:08:00</a> 反复观看厕所的那一巴掌 Tom这个dick sucker也需要被捧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a> Greg演员现实生活中被是指控滥用权力的predator</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">1:14:00</a> 一些无底线的“上位”小技巧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">1:15:00</a> If I give you something good, can you give me something great?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4610">1:16:50</a> 最不内耗的角色 从不羞耻说出需求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">1:18:00</a> Tom和Matsson餐桌对话的loyalty test</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4785">1:19:45</a> 反PUA第一课：如何抵抗NPD人格的操纵？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">1:22:00</a> Connor is another level</span></p><p><span>Songs from album&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Succession: Season 4 (HBO Original Series Soundtrack)</span></p><p><span>Intro:</span></p><p><span>A Piacere di Nuovo</span></p><p><span>Interlude:</span></p><p><span>Lamentoso - 'Needy Love Sponges'</span></p><p><span>'My Dear, Dear, World of a Father'</span></p><p><span>Outro:</span></p><p><span>It’s Done</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/nm1fepguEt5pO0aLK9_mMgI555FI.mp3" length="103466756" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:13</itunes:duration>
