  <item>
    <title>ep26. 讨好型人格or not: I was just being nice?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64454479420fc63f0b9c87cd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64454479420fc63f0b9c87cd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Apr 2023 14:45:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> “维护和气”的本能 免除他人尴尬的责任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 讨好= being nice for no reason?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 替过错方考虑是不是一种讨好in disguise</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 第一时间的愤怒和争取应有的权益</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 对熟人很难生气 反观对陌生人“路怒人格”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 维护原则和底线不会轻易被影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 边界感很小就形成了 对情绪绑架特别敏感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 为了保护亲近的人激发“斗志”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 当下伸张正义和砍价中的面子问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 只要不是局内人 尴尬的就是别人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 建议在职场中练习拒绝和亮明底线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 退回到level 1 把讨好当成社交货币</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 社交产生的情绪压力 介绍朋友认识（？突然的ntr</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 做调和者的割裂感 不同社交群体的人格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 每个人都是复杂多面的 很多友谊似乎是为了建立某种联盟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 人格在evolve 健康的成长是产生新的共识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 开放式的态度反而容易有惊喜感 当没有特定完美形象的时候接受度会更高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> “讨好型“or高敏感人格 贴标签的行为可能造成二次伤害 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 在错误的地方释放善意</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 郎朗的教学视频太上头了</span></p><p><span>Songs：</span></p><p><span>Intro: Gone Girl— SZA</span></p><p><span>Outro: Eye In The Sky— The Alan Parsons Project</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ng8S2imIMzZsaOaW_OGqmqOhlaT2.m4a" length="73703617" type="audio/mp4"/>
