  <item>
    <title>ep25. 我们被羞耻感支配的一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64196e538aca9099d7ea469d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64196e538aca9099d7ea469d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Mar 2023 08:44:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 大多数羞耻感是“人工”的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> 迫害来源于对女性力量的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 男性在择偶上的不安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 女性最初对生命的绝对掌控权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 对男老师表白被slut shaming</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 上学时来自女性长辈“淑女”的规训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 羞耻情绪是对自己的self worth产生怀疑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 对拉黑别人“做坏人”的羞耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 正义感的倾斜 没有绝对正确的底气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 对即时满足 “能吃能睡”的厌弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 说别人酒后失态算一种shaming吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3209">53:29</a> 自我克制是常态 释放天性后更真实立体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> “乱花钱”产生耻感 但越压抑越想买</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3696">1:01:36</a> 羞耻感可能是对尊严的保护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3870">1:04:30</a> 对不能无法照顾自己的耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3977">1:06:17</a> 关于一个反复出现的噩梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">1:12:40</a> 用心而不是脑去思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4470">1:14:30</a> 用心感受可以解锁自己更多的内在自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4665">1:17:45</a> 清空大脑 终于得到了休息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4790">1:19:50</a> 冥想需要持之以恒的练习</span></p><span></span><p><span>Songs:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Intro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wildfire- Berndsen</span></p><span></span><p><span>Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Louie Bag- YEBBA/Smino</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhPps0y_dq7WCZilic6wuR0ADh_B.m4a" length="127827315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkdXMbrnbr9YNLDPYyD8FWHa5af0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep24. 刘炀：我在小区地库办派对</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/638b331bf6753f4e9d4d5e47</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">638b331bf6753f4e9d4d5e47</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Dec 2022 11:29:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgCtKKOZy9jY3j8MSMmzivqDvg1z.jpeg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 《方舱即兴计划》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a> 特定环境下的化学反应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> Techno音乐像是“机器在歌唱”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> “空气纸”乐队名的由来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 怎么想到做一个小区派对？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 保持表达/创作的习惯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 从《夏夜舞步》到现在审美的成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 追求技术的革新</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 疫情前后国内地下场景</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> Gravitational Factory立足小众的独立厂牌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> “不正经的”小区party 小孩、阿姨、年轻人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> party 2.0特殊原因无法进行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 想搞一个小区电子厂牌：居民exclusive</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 没有在做行为艺术 想找回属于自己的生活方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 音乐是天然的自我表达</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Ca9HD6kRaH4U-UtjZnonfdBG5.jpeg"></figure><p><span>Songs：</span></p><p><span>Intro: Shifting-刘炀 李睿洋</span></p><p><span>Interlude: Logic Two-刘炀</span></p><p><span>Scene feedback-刘炀</span></p><p><span>Outro: Amber Dark-刘炀</span></p><p><span>Photo credit：</span></p><p><span>郭狗子</span></p><p><span>海报设计：</span></p><p><span>JasonVee</span></p>]]></description>
